    ci_rust_bootstrap_multiplatform_all_lanes_red_2026-08-31, 1, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/ci_rust_bootstrap_multiplatform_all_lanes_red_2026-08-31.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    ci_rust_bootstrap_multiplatform_all_lanes_red_2026-08-31, 2, "2026-11-09 p3-subj6: FIXED by content re-verification on release/1.0.0. Cause A: runtime_log_hosted.c now has a real Win32 backend (_MSC_VER/clang-cl -> io.h+SSIZE_T+_write), host cc -fsyntax-only clean. Cause B: workflow installs libfreetype6-dev (line 355/862). Cause D: cross matrix has x86_64-pc-windows-gnu with gcc-mingw-w64-x86-64, clang selector, and rustup target add (line 936); aarch64/riscv64 lanes triaged into the same matrix. Causes C/E fixed per sibling record. Workflow YAML parses. CI green run NOT executed (no cargo/CI in lane) - true proof of B/D is a workflow run. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/ci_rust_bootstrap_multiplatform_all_lanes_red_2026-08-31.md Re-verification 2026-11-09"

